WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:06.921
If someone in your town asked you today, “Where can my dad talk to someone about stem cells?” where would you send them?

00:00:07.261 --> 00:00:11.251
Most people do not have an answer. This is about becoming the answer.

00:00:11.971 --> 00:00:16.914
Imagine being able to say, “Have him call my office. I’ll introduce him to the team.”

00:00:17.634 --> 00:00:23.791
A doctor is seeking a non-doctor partner to open a stem cell and regenerative office in your city.

00:00:24.511 --> 00:00:28.995
You do not need a medical license. You own the business, and you build it locally.

00:00:29.335 --> 00:00:34.369
People bring you their questions, and a licensed clinical team answers the medical ones.

00:00:35.089 --> 00:00:41.661
You are not starting from nothing. The legal structure for your state is built, and physician oversight is in place.

00:00:42.001 --> 00:00:49.399
A nurse practitioner performs the procedures at your office. You order from more than 20 biologics at partner pricing.

00:00:50.119 --> 00:00:54.394
And when your number gets passed along, an assistant answers it, day or night.

00:00:55.114 --> 00:01:00.340
The minimum investment is $100,000. A local office is required.

00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:03.460
We are placing a limited number of partnerships.

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:08.514
See if you qualify. It takes about a minute, costs nothing and commits you to nothing.
